00:00:06.393 --> 00:00:09.295
&gt;&gt; Sean: YOU MAY HAVE SEEN OUR

00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:11.426
GRIPPING AND SAD INTERVIEW LAST

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.538
WEEK WITH HORACE LORENZO

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.145
ANDERSON SR., THE FATHER WHO

00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:15.576
TOLD US ABOUT THE HEARTBREAKING

00:00:15.578 --> 00:00:17.029
EXPERIENCE HE LOST HIS

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.658
19-YEAR-OLD SON IN THE SUMMER OF

00:00:19.659 --> 00:00:22.020
LOVE, CHOPPED AND CHAZ ZONE.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:23.648
NOW MR. ANDERSON HAS RECEIVED AN

00:00:23.682 --> 00:00:25.323
OUTPOURING OF SUPPORT INCLUDING

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.608
WE ARE TOLD A PHONE CALL FROM

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.222
THE PRESIDENT, PRESIDENT TRUMP,

00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:32.420
AND FINALLY A MEETING WITH

00:00:32.455 --> 00:00:33.444
SEATTLE’S MAYOR.

00:00:33.478 --> 00:00:37.591
HE RETURNS TONIGHT TO GIVE US AN

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:39.691
UPDATE ALONG WITH ANDRE TAYLOR.

00:00:39.725 --> 00:00:41.767
MR. ANDERSON, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:43.624
BEING BACK.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:45.998
EVERYBODY ASKS ME, NOBODY CALLED

00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:47.112
MR. ANDERSON?

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.233
DURING THIS SHOW, AS IT WAS

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.708
GOING ON, THE WHITE HOUSE

00:00:50.709 --> 00:00:51.883
SWITCHBOARD CALLED ASKING FOR

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.636
YOUR NUMBER.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.425
WHAT HAS HAPPENED SINCE?

00:00:55.426 --> 00:00:58.039
&gt;&gt; A LOT OF THINGS HAVE HAPPENED

00:00:58.073 --> 00:00:59.661
JUST BECAUSE OF YOUR SHOW, I

00:00:59.662 --> 00:00:59.950
BELIEVE.

00:00:59.951 --> 00:01:03.115
I WANTED TO SAY FIRST OF ALL,

00:01:03.116 --> 00:01:05.158
WANT TO GIVE MY HEART OUT TO

00:01:05.193 --> 00:01:07.394
EVERYONE BECAUSE OF YOUR SHOW,

00:01:07.428 --> 00:01:10.123
PEOPLE HAVE BEEN REACHING OUT TO

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:11.863
THE WITH THE MOST, THE BEST,

00:01:11.897 --> 00:01:13.014
AROUND THE WORLD.

00:01:13.049 --> 00:01:14.676
I’VE GOTTEN CARDS FROM AROUND

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.091
THE WORLD.

00:01:15.092 --> 00:01:16.645
PEOPLE I DON’T EVEN KNOW

00:01:16.679 --> 00:01:18.090
REACHING OUT TO ME, SAYING THAT

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.126
YOU’RE A GREAT DAD AND DIFFERENT

00:01:19.127 --> 00:01:19.564
THINGS.

00:01:19.565 --> 00:01:22.474
I WISH I HAD A DAD LIKE YOU,

00:01:22.509 --> 00:01:24.706
THINGS LIKE THIS, YOU KNOW.

00:01:24.707 --> 00:01:25.748
IT’S BEEN VERY OVERWHELMING.

00:01:25.783 --> 00:01:27.059
&gt;&gt; Sean: HOW WAS THE

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:27.790
PRESIDENT’S CALL?

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:30.103
TELL US ABOUT THAT.

00:01:30.104 --> 00:01:32.616
&gt;&gt; KIND OF LIKE JUST, YOU KNOW,

00:01:32.651 --> 00:01:34.076
BASIC, HE CALLED AND GAVE HIS

00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:34.484
CONDOLENCES.

00:01:34.518 --> 00:01:36.560
YOU KNOW, LIKE I SAID, A PHONE

00:01:36.594 --> 00:01:38.353
CALL IS LIKE, YOU KNOW, I CALL

00:01:38.354 --> 00:01:39.657
YOU AND TELL YOU I LOVE YOU.

00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:41.198
I CAN TELL YOU THAT.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:43.284
IT’S A DIFFERENT THING WHEN

00:01:43.285 --> 00:01:44.801
SOMEBODY’S RIGHT THERE EMBRACING

00:01:44.803 --> 00:01:46.496
YOU AND TELLING YOU YOU LOVE

00:01:46.531 --> 00:01:46.957
THEM.

00:01:46.992 --> 00:01:48.296
YOU CAN FEEL THE LOVE.

00:01:48.297 --> 00:01:50.297
I’M NOT INTO POLITICS SO I DON’T

00:01:50.298 --> 00:01:54.340
KNOW IF THE CONVERSATION WAS

00:01:54.341 --> 00:01:55.678
JUST CONVERSATION.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:59.865
&gt;&gt; Sean: MR. TAYLOR, WHAT

00:01:59.867 --> 00:02:01.126
ABOUT THE MAYOR?

00:02:01.127 --> 00:02:02.434
INEXCUSABLE, MR. TAYLOR.

00:02:02.435 --> 00:02:04.831
SHE ALLOWED THIS TO HAPPEN.

00:02:04.865 --> 00:02:05.673
SHE DIDN’T PROTECT

00:02:05.707 --> 00:02:07.030
MR. ANDERSON’S SON.

00:02:07.065 --> 00:02:08.780
SHE SHOULD HAVE PROTECTED THE

00:02:08.815 --> 00:02:10.505
CITY, THE PEOPLE OF HER CITY.

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:12.928
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO GO BACK TO THE

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.876
PRESIDENT’S PHONE BECAUSE WE

00:02:14.877 --> 00:02:17.248
WERE BOTH ON THE PHONE CALL.

00:02:17.249 --> 00:02:18.244
THE PRESIDENT WAS EXTREMELY

00:02:18.278 --> 00:02:19.193
GRACIOUS.

00:02:19.228 --> 00:02:24.078
HE CALLED AT A PERFECT TIME,
DURING THE FUNERAL SERVICES.

00:02:24.079 --> 00:02:27.608
DURING THE FUNERAL SERVICES.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:36.401
IT JUST LIFTED HORACE UP.

00:02:36.435 --> 00:02:40.609
HE WAS ELATED, SCREAMING, I GOT

00:02:40.644 --> 00:02:42.156
A CALL FROM THE PRESIDENT.

00:02:42.157 --> 00:02:43.229
I DON’T WANT TO BELITTLE THE

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.081
POWER OF THE PRESIDENCY OR THE

00:02:44.082 --> 00:02:44.644
SEAT OF THE PRESIDENCY.

00:02:44.645 --> 00:02:45.348
IT WAS VERY, VERY SPECIAL FOR

00:02:45.349 --> 00:02:46.023
HIM AND IT WAS VERY, VERY

00:02:46.058 --> 00:02:46.538
SPECIAL FOR MYSELF.

00:02:46.573 --> 00:02:47.319
WHATEVER YOUR POLITICS ARE, IT

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:47.739
DOESN’T MATTER.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.727
THE OFFICE IS THE MOST POWERFUL

00:02:49.761 --> 00:02:51.906
OFFICE IN THIS WORLD AND TO BE

00:02:51.941 --> 00:02:53.308
ABLE TO RECEIVE A PHONE CALL

00:02:53.342 --> 00:02:55.683
FROM THE PRESIDENT, HE GETS NO

00:02:55.718 --> 00:02:56.484
HIGHER THAN THAT.

00:02:56.485 --> 00:02:57.996
I JUST WANT TO MAKE SURE WE

00:02:57.998 --> 00:02:58.621
COVERED THAT.

00:02:58.622 --> 00:03:00.361
&gt;&gt; Sean: I GOT A LOT OF

00:03:00.362 --> 00:03:01.843
REACTION TOO AND EVERYBODY THAT

00:03:01.844 --> 00:03:03.204
I HAVE TALKED TO, EVERYONE

00:03:03.205 --> 00:03:04.944
THAT’S WRITTEN ME, EVERYONE I

00:03:04.945 --> 00:03:06.993
SAW OVER THE WEEKEND SINCE THEIR

00:03:06.995 --> 00:03:08.912
LOVE AND PRAYERS TO YOU AND I

